The \bf IconEditor\rm  demo uses DrawCanvas for a scalable pixel grid and a
live preview. Pull-down menus and a toolbar drive New/Open/Save; the toolbox
offers pencil, line, rect, circle, fill and undo. Left-drag draws with the
current colour; right-click/drag erases to transparent. The file chooser opens
XPM icons and Save writes a plain XPM file. Quit asks whether to save first.
